#scene("std_visual")

@bg("classroom")
@show("alice_smile", position="left")

The classroom background is visible, and Alice is standing on the left.

:: Alice
The std-visual plugin only stores visual state.

@show("bob_normal", position="right")

:: Bob
The example app maps asset IDs to SVG files and renders them.

@hide("alice_smile")

Alice is hidden now. Bob remains on the right.

@show("alice_smile", position="center")

:: Alice
Now I am back in the center.

@show("bob_normal", position="center")

Both sprites can share the same position without crashing.
